From 535bbd2b9b083ad949a58b389c357a373987788f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlessandroRCL <alessandro.1901.ramiro@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:28:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(monitoring): add monitoring dashboard with flow,
 pressure and device status

Readings accept optional flow, pressure and battery telemetry, and each reading
refreshes the connection status of its device. GET /api/v1/monitoring/dashboard
consolidates the consumption of today and of the month, the live flow and pressure,
the status of the devices and the telemetry of each Water Point, by location.
